{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "One in a Krillion",
    "steam_appid": 2924160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924160/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1718426362\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>In this action game, prepare for waves of dynamic deep-sea action! Players take the role of King Krilliam, who leads swarms of krill against hordes of krill predators looking for their next meal. Utilize the strength of a krillion krill to swat away your enemies in the forms of Krill constructs. With hammers, scissors, and more unique construct abilities, master the way of the krill and lay your claim to your home. Deep sea trouble awaits you in an atoll themed tussle!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924160/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1718426362\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Utilize 6 different Krill Konstructs to fight against swarms of predators.<br></li><li>Master solo mode's deadly precision and swarm mode's area-wide strikes.<br></li><li>Face off against 4+ unique enemies with distinct patterns and attacks. <br></li><li>Land the best combos and keep up your rank to inspire your krill.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924160/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1718426362\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924160/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1718426362\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>In this action game, prepare for waves of dynamic deep-sea action! Players take the role of King Krilliam, who leads swarms of krill against hordes of krill predators looking for their next meal. Utilize the strength of a krillion krill to swat away your enemies in the forms of Krill constructs. With hammers, scissors, and more unique construct abilities, master the way of the krill and lay your claim to your home. Deep sea trouble awaits you in an atoll themed tussle!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924160/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1718426362\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Utilize 6 different Krill Konstructs to fight against swarms of predators.<br></li><li>Master solo mode's deadly precision and swarm mode's area-wide strikes.<br></li><li>Face off against 4+ unique enemies with distinct patterns and attacks. <br></li><li>Land the best combos and keep up your rank to inspire your krill.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924160/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1718426362\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
